WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The data is in the report.
No retyping in the office.
A close-up of the report draft in the demo.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Enter the readings once.
Record this inspection’s results.
Site details are ready. The technician adds fresh readings.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The photo has context.
Painted sprinkler. Room 214.
The photo, location and finding stay with the inspection.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Same readings. In the report.
Field entries become a draft.
Readings, the photo and the finding are ready for office review.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Check the source record.
See what the technician submitted.
Missing a detail? Return the inspection for clarification.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Approval stays with you.
Reviewed first. Then released.
Approving the report does not close the deficiency.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Now try the same inspection.
Open the interactive demo.
Use the sample readings and see the report they produce.
